Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.92,0:00:04.88,Clip,,0,0,0,,Wie gehts euch denn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.23,0:00:09.79,Clip,,0,0,0,,Gehts euch gut?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:11.71,Clip,,0,0,0,,Ich hoffe ihr seid {\c&H0022DDFF&}alle{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.71,0:00:13.39,Clip,,0,0,0,,fit. {\c&H0022DDFF&}Alles{\c&H00FFFFFF&} gut bei euch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.87,0:00:14.81,Clip,,0,0,0,,Ey danke erst mal, ich
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.81,0:00:15.41,Clip,,0,0,0,,muss mich hier kurz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.71,Clip,,0,0,0,,bedanken. Warte mal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.69,0:00:19.37,Clip,,0,0,0,,Erst mal, warte mal, warte
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.37,0:00:20.73,Clip,,0,0,0,,mal, warte, warte, warte,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.73,0:00:21.18,Clip,,0,0,0,,warte.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.25,0:00:24.03,Clip,,0,0,0,,Erst mal dank an Karibik
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:25.97,Clip,,0,0,0,,Hendrik für dein Abo vor
